Amendment for the checking and testing utilities. The same permission covers running the
included utilities, harness/check.py and harness/autopilot.py, on your own computer. They
read your experiment scripts; write reports, screenshots and copies of the experiment folder
under a .autopilot/ folder beside the script; and launch your installed Vizard in desktop
mode. They send nothing to WorldViz and run no service of their own; an experiment they run,
and the installed SightLab and Vizard, may communicate with the devices and services that
experiment is set up to use.

